  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ungdomsstyrelsen TUR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth Politics TUR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2/3 of the population in Turkey are people younger than 30, therefore it is extremely important to work with this group and make it an active group in formulate politics for a Turkey as an EU-member. The Swedish National Board for Youth has since a couple of years cooperated on a low level with its counterparts in Turkey. During 2006 a prestudy took place, which resulted in a youth politics proj.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Turkiets befolkning best&#xe5;r till 2/3 av personer yngre &#xe4;n 30 &#xe5;r och det &#xe4;r d&#xe4;rf&#xf6;r ytterst angel&#xe4;get att alla f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringsprocesser startar i denna grupp. Ungdomsstyrelsen har sedan n&#xe5;gra &#xe5;r haft ett mindre samarbete med sina motparter i Turkiet. Under h&#xf6;sten 2006 genomf&#xf6;rde U-styrelsen en f&#xf6;rstudie som ligger till grund f&#xf6;r detta projekt d&#xe4;r m&#xe5;let bl a&#xe4;r att formulera en ungdomspolitik med ungdomars deltagane.</narrative>
  </description>
